('Bench Press (Barbell)', 'Chest', array['Triceps','Shoulders']::text[], 'Barbell', 'weight_reps', 'Lie on a flat bench, grip slightly wider than shoulders. Lower the bar to mid-chest under control, then press up without locking out hard.'),
