('Chest Fly (Dumbbell)', 'Chest', '{}'::text[], 'Dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'Lying flat with a slight elbow bend, open your arms in a wide arc until you feel a chest stretch, then squeeze back together above your chest.'),
